{"id":59207,"date":"2026-08-13T07:22:28","date_gmt":"2026-08-13T06:22:28","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:36:05","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:36:05","slug":"corrida-dos-reis-bencao-do-atleta","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-dos-reis-bencao-do-atleta\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>8\u00aa Corrida dos Reis \u2013 Ben\u00e7\u00e3o do Atleta 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>10 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, na cidade-santu\u00e1rio de <strong>F\u00e1tima<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Our\u00e9m<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>FET &#8211; F\u00e1tima Escola de Triatlo<\/strong> com o apoio das entidades locais, a prova combina a tradi\u00e7\u00e3o atl\u00e9tica de in\u00edcio de ano com a emocionante cerim\u00f3nia ecum\u00e9nica da b\u00ean\u00e7\u00e3o de todos os corredores e caminheiros.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada no Passeio Pedonal da Avenida Dom Jos\u00e9 Alves Correia da Silva (junto ao Posto de Turismo), o evento tem in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong>09h00 com a B\u00ean\u00e7\u00e3o dos Atletas<\/strong>, arrancando a <strong>Corrida Principal de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>, a <strong>Caminhada de 7 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h35<\/strong> e a <strong>Prova Jovem<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>12h30<\/strong>. O evento conta com banhos no Est\u00e1dio Papa Francisco, refor\u00e7os s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos e medalhas comemorativas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 09:30<\/s